<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA-AARE KILP TO BE HOIUPANK'S NEW CHAIRMAN-REPORT.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA-AARE KILP TO BE HOIUPANK'S NEW CHAIRMAN-REPORT.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hoiupank's board chose Aare Kilp on Friday to become chairman of the bank's management board on January 1 1998, Aripaev business daily said on Monday.</p>
<p>Kilp, 30, a current board member, was chosen from six candidates and will replace out-going board chairman Olari Taal, the paper added.</p>
<p>--Tallinn newsroom +372 620 9202 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
